    {
      "type": "text", "id": "core_loop_teaching_note", "x": 72, "y": 972, "width": 850, "height": 120,
      "text": "HTTP request ≠ core step\n\n• 1 个 step 可推进多个 request\n• 1 个 request 通常跨多轮 step\n• prefill / decode 共用 Scheduler token budget\n• SchedulerOutput 不是 HTTP schema", "originalText": "HTTP request ≠ core step\n\n• 1 个 step 可推进多个 request\n• 1 个 request 通常跨多轮 step\n• prefill / decode 共用 Scheduler token budget\n• SchedulerOutput 不是 HTTP schema",
